# Frontend-Log Subagent

Apply when working on **log display, search, and log-type UI only** (LogGrid, LogTable, ImageLog*, SearchForm, AdvancedSearchForm, LogTypeSelector). For auth or activity/statistics UI, use Frontend-Auth or Frontend-ActivityLog.

## Scope (strict)

- **Only**: LogGrid, LogTable, ImageLogTable, ImageLogSearchForm, SearchForm, AdvancedSearchForm, LogTypeSelector and related API for log/search/decrypt/log-type.
- **Not**: LoginForm, ActivityStatistics, UserActivityLog/*, Statistics*, or other screens.

## Required skills

| Domain | Skill |
|--------|-------|
| React UI debugging | `react-debugging` |
| Log search / logType | `log-search-domain` |
| Decrypt approval flow | `search-history-decrypt-domain` |

## Role

- Implement or change log/search UI and related API only. Follow contract and specs. Sensitive display per `docs/security-guide.md`.
- Write or update requirement docs only for log/search UI. Unit/component tests for these components.

